  </div>
  ```
- Hook it up like `#shakeSw`: clicking flips `S.sfx`, `paintSettings()` sets `aria-pressed`, and the click calls `saveState()`. "Reset progress" must keep this setting, just as it keeps the others.
- Change the Music row's description from "The only sound in the game." to "The soundtrack of each level."
